title: Start
---
<<declare $curious = false>>
<<background bg.room>>
<<sound sfx.chime>>
Guide: Welcome to Weftora. Everything you see comes from a Story folder, not from Rust code.
Guide: Want to see a choice change the game state?
-> Yes, show me.
    <<set $curious = true>>
-> Not right now.
    <<set $curious = false>>
<<jump Result>>
===
title: Result
---
<<if $curious>>
    Guide: You looked closer, so the state key "curious" is now true.
<<else>>
    Guide: Fair enough. The state key "curious" stays false.
<<endif>>
Guide: That is the whole walking skeleton. Edit dialogue/intro.yarn and run it again.
===
